"""Direct question-design review of mantra and yoga."""
from review_angle_plans import revise_domain, audit

MANTRA = """history_origins|A Mantra in Its Earliest Witness|Where does one named mantra appear in surviving sources?|Distinguish composition, oral transmission, manuscript copy, and later use.
famous_examples|A Familiar Mantra in Context|What does one widely known mantra mean within its source tradition?|Check exact wording, setting, translation, and practitioner explanation.
hidden_stories|Teachers of Recitation|Whose teaching work preserves one recitation tradition?|Use consented accounts and records of a named community.
beginner_explainers|What the Word Mantra Covers|How do two traditions use mantra in different ways?|Specify language, textual source, purpose, and access rules.
advanced_concepts|Sound, Text, and Meaning|How do named lineages relate pronunciation, meaning, and practice?|Compare their own explanations rather than imposing one theory.
mysteries_unsolved_cases|A Contested Mantra Attribution|Which source first attests a claimed mantra form?|Compare dated citations, manuscripts, oral accounts, and gaps.
technology_innovation|Archiving Sacred Recitation|Can a recording preserve a chant while respecting community control?|Check consent, metadata, fidelity, access restrictions, and stewardship.
people_personalities|A Teacher's Transmission Role|What can records establish about one named transmitter or composer?|Separate attributed lineage from documented biography.
major_events|A Recitation Enters Public Circulation|What changed after one dated publication or recording?|Compare access, interpretation, permission, and community response.
how_it_works|Learning a Recitation Tradition|How do teachers describe accuracy and meaning in one public curriculum?|Document teaching principles without giving restricted instructions.
rise_fall|A Recitation Branch's Continuity|Why did one branch gain or lose opportunities for teaching?|Use dated school, patronage, and practitioner evidence.
then_vs_now|A Mantra Across Generations|How did the use of one mantra change in a named community?|Compare source records and consented living accounts.
future_developments|A Preservation Decision|What would one archiving or teaching proposal protect or expose?|Assess custodial consent, access, costs, and living transmission.
myths_vs_facts|A Universal Meaning for One Sound?|Does a popular translation fit the specific source and lineage?|Compare language, context, commentary, and variant uses.
documentary_stories|A Mantra's Textual Journey|How did one phrase move through recensions, print, and performance?|Trace named witnesses and later reinterpretations.
text_source|Finding the Exact Mantra|Which text, recension, and passage contain a claimed formula?|Cite edition, wording, and variants before interpreting it.
interpretive_lineages|Two Explanations of One Mantra|How do named communities understand the same words differently?|Represent each explanation with attribution and context.
lived_practice|A Practitioner's Relationship to Recitation|What does one consented account reveal about meaning and setting?|Respect privacy and avoid generalizing from one participant.
ritual_sequence|A Mantra Within an Observance|Where does a public recitation occur in one local rite?|Describe context with permission, without prescribing restricted practice.
language_translation|A Syllable or Word in Translation|What meaning is altered when one mantra term is rendered in English?|Compare phonetic form, grammar, and practitioner commentary.
regional_variants|One Formula, Different Recitations|How do two named communities transmit related wording?|Compare source lineage, pronunciation records, and local explanation.
art_and_devotion|A Mantra in Visual or Musical Form|How is one formula represented in an artwork or song?|Distinguish creative interpretation from textual source.
community_memory|Remembering a Mantra's Transmission|How does a lineage narrate who taught one formula?|Present attributed memory beside dated evidence.
ethics_in_context|Who May Record or Share?|How does one community set boundaries around a mantra's access?|Use custodial voices and written permissions; avoid publishing restricted material.
source_and_history|Oral and Written Witnesses|What can recordings and manuscripts each establish about one formula?|Date the witnesses without conflating their age with the practice's origin.
encounter_and_exchange|A Mantra in Another Setting|What changed when one formula moved between communities or into commerce?|Trace documented transfer, consent, and altered purpose.
contemporary_voice|A Reciter on Meaning and Care|What does a current practitioner want outsiders to understand?|Use consent and distinguish personal view from lineage-wide policy.
field_textual_lineage|One Formula Across Editions|Which textual variants appear in named witnesses?|Record exact source, recension, and editorial decisions.
field_regional_practice|A Local Recitation Community|How is one mantra taught and situated in daily life?|Use permission and document place, lineage, and access.
field_translation_choice|A Mantra Term in Two Renderings|Which linguistic evidence supports alternative translations?|Compare original context and commentarial readings.
field_ritual_context|Recitation in One Rite|What is the public role of a named formula in one observance?|Ask custodians and omit restricted sequence or wording.
field_community_interpretation|A Lineage Explains a Formula|How do members interpret one mantra and its boundaries?|Attribute views and include internal differences."""

YOGA = """history_origins|Yoga in a Named Source|What does one dated text mean by yoga in its own context?|Distinguish textual concept, later lineage, and modern class format.
famous_examples|A Popular Yoga Style Examined|What practices and aims define one widely taught style?|Compare curriculum, teacher lineage, participants, and variations.
hidden_stories|Teachers and Communities Behind a Style|Whose work is missing from a founder-centered yoga history?|Use dated materials and consented teacher and student accounts.
beginner_explainers|Yoga as Philosophy and Practice|How do a named text and a present school use the word yoga?|Present their distinct aims without collapsing yoga into postures.
advanced_concepts|Studying a Multi-Part Yoga Program|How can research separate posture, breath, attention, and group effects?|Define intervention, comparator, adherence, outcomes, and harms.
mysteries_unsolved_cases|A Historical Continuity Claim|What evidence supports a claimed direct line from an old text to a modern style?|Trace teachers, manuals, and changes; state gaps.
technology_innovation|Online Yoga Instruction|Does one digital format preserve accessibility and safety?|Compare supervision, feedback, privacy, and reported adverse events.
people_personalities|A Teacher's Documented Contribution|What did one named teacher change in a yoga curriculum?|Compare earlier and later manuals, recordings, and accounts.
major_events|Yoga Enters a New Institution|What changed when one practice entered a school, clinic, or public program?|Compare purpose, curriculum, instructor standards, and evaluation.
how_it_works|What a Named Yoga Class Contains|Which components distinguish one program from another?|Describe study or curriculum design without giving exercise instructions.
rise_fall|A Style's Spread and Revision|Why did one yoga style expand or change?|Use teaching records, publications, institutions, and participant demand.
then_vs_now|A Text and a Modern Studio|Which ideas persisted and which practices changed?|Compare named source, lineage history, and current curriculum.
future_developments|A Training or Access Proposal|What would one proposal need to improve safety and inclusion?|Assess teacher preparation, adaptations, cost, and evaluation.
myths_vs_facts|Yoga as a Cure?|Does a health claim fit trials of the exact style and condition?|Check comparator, population, benefit, injury, and current guidance.
documentary_stories|A Yoga Claim's Source Trail|How did one textual or health claim move into public marketing?|Trace source, teacher statement, study, and later correction.
text_source|Yoga in a Specific Passage|What does one named text actually state about yoga?|Cite edition, chapter, translation, and surrounding argument.
interpretive_lineages|Two Philosophies of Yoga|How do named lineages differ on the purpose of practice?|Represent each from its own texts and teachers.
lived_practice|A Participant's Reasons|What does one consented practitioner seek from a named yoga program?|Separate personal aims from evidence of clinical benefit.
ritual_sequence|Yoga Within a Living Observance|How does one community integrate yoga into a public observance?|Ask practitioners and respect restricted parts.
language_translation|A Yoga Term in Context|How does translating one Sanskrit term change the perceived practice?|Compare linguistic and commentarial evidence.
regional_variants|One Yoga Style in Two Places|How do training and practice differ across settings?|Compare lineage, local culture, access, and teacher preparation.
art_and_devotion|Yoga in Image and Performance|What ideal does one artwork or performance express?|Distinguish artistic depiction from a historical technique manual.
community_memory|Remembering a Yoga Lineage|How does a community tell its teaching history?|Compare attributed memory with dated publications and records.
ethics_in_context|Safety, Consent, and Adaptation|How does one program handle participant limits and instructor power?|Read policy, adverse-event reporting, and participant accounts; avoid personal advice.
source_and_history|A Yoga Manual's Provenance|What can editions and citations show about a named manual?|Separate date of copy, composition, and later interpretation.
encounter_and_exchange|Yoga in a New Cultural Setting|What changed when one style was adapted across communities?|Trace training, language, purpose, consent, and commercial use.
contemporary_voice|A Teacher and Student on Yoga's Purpose|Where do present participants agree or differ about a practice?|Attribute voices and avoid treating one as universal.
field_textual_lineage|A Yoga Passage Across Witnesses|Which variants matter to interpretation of one text?|Compare manuscript base, edition, and translation.
field_regional_practice|A Local Yoga School|How is a named style taught and adapted in one community?|Document curriculum, consent, and instructor qualifications.
field_translation_choice|Two Renderings of Yoga Vocabulary|What would each rendering imply in a bounded passage?|Compare grammar, context, and named commentaries.
field_ritual_context|Yoga and an Observance|What role does a yoga practice have in one named rite or gathering?|Use participant permission and avoid instruction.
field_community_interpretation|A Lineage Defines Yoga|How do members explain its aims and boundaries?|Represent internal diversity and distinguish doctrine from clinical evidence."""

if __name__ == "__main__":
    revise_domain("277", "277_mantra", MANTRA,
                  "Named mantra sources, oral transmission, translation, devotional context, community consent, and responsible archiving.",
                  "specified textual recensions and translations, recordings with custodian permission, manuscript catalogues, teaching records, and consented practitioner accounts",
                  "Name the source and lineage; respect restricted or initiated material and publication permissions. Attribute spiritual meanings and avoid presenting recitation as a proven medical treatment.")
    revise_domain("280", "280_yoga", YOGA,
                  "Yoga as varied textual philosophy and living practice, including modern adaptations, clinical evidence, instruction quality, and safety.",
                  "specified primary texts and translations, lineage and teaching records, registered trials and systematic reviews, current guidance, adverse-event reports, and consented accounts",
                  "Name the style, components, instructor context, population, and outcome. Distinguish spiritual aims from clinical claims; give no exercise or treatment instructions and verify safety in current guidance.")
    rows = audit()
    print(f"Plans: {len(rows)}; reviewed question designs: {sum(r['status'] == 'editorial_question_reviewed' for r in rows)}")
